---
name: Normalize Codex OTLP to OCSF
description: >
  Subscribes to native OTLP events, normalizes security-relevant Codex
  telemetry, and publishes OCSF events to the `ocsf` topic.
disabled: true
restart-on-error: 1m
---

subscribe "otlp"
openai::codex::ocsf
ocsf_derive
ocsf_cast
publish "ocsf"
